1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,900
Morning walk at the penguin kindergarten. One of them has a different plan.

2
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:06,300
This is Mochi. The pebble from Mom means "home."

3
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:10,200
That day, the whale ferry came in. Yes. A whale.

4
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:13,600
Mochi's nose picked up a lead.

5
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:16,800
Fish. An entire crate of it.

6
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:20,300
Self-control was never part of the plan.

7
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:24,200
Dinner's over. Food coma begins.

8
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:27,900
Pelicans are thorough workers. Stamp: to the city.

9
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:31,400
Nobody asked why the crate was snoring.

10
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:35,300
One, two, three, four… five?

11
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:39,200
And so Mochi crossed the ocean. Asleep.

12
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:42,400
There was a storm, too.

13
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:45,800
When Mochi woke up, the light looked… wrong.

14
00:00:46,050 --> 00:00:49,500
Antarctic light doesn't blink pink.

15
00:00:49,750 --> 00:00:54,100
Outside the box, there was no snow.

16
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:59,100
Can Mochi find the way home? (To be continued)

